## SQ-CCB-01 | [jeiOrder] defined once; jei tags as before; a node tag lists its members; no creativecommon:jei/ tag
@group A (full pack)
@commands boot, `/reload`; `grep -nE "jeiOrder\|jei_order\|fluid_jei" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| head`; `/kubejs tags item creativecompat:jei/equipment/tools/copper` (or any node with members)
@pass `[jeiOrder] defined N nodes` once; `item: N jei tags` as before; the tag lists its members; no `creativecommon:jei/` tag left
@fails helper not loaded from the Compat jar pack, `TAG_ROOT`
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell grep -nE "jeiOrder|jei_order|fluid_jei" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | head -12
shell test "$(grep -c "\[jeiOrder\] defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 1
> cdevtest tag item creativecompat:jei/equipment/chainmail
> cdevtest tag item creativecommon:jei/equipment/chainmail
waitlog verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecommon:jei/equipment/chainmail n= 30
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecompat:jei/equipment/chainmail n=[1-9]\d* 
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecommon:jei/equipment/chainmail n=0 
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look `[jeiOrder] defined N nodes` once (43 in the 11-12 pack log); `item: N jei tags` (35). Tag copper had 0 members in the 11-10 dump, so the row uses chainmail (6). The /reload of SQ-PA-02 has run before this row

## CQ-CCB-01
@group client, Common alone (CEPortTesting: copy Common 20:00 into mods/)
@commands launch, new world; `grep -nE "magic_resistance.png\|JEIEvents\|jei_order\|damage-tags" logs/latest.log`; `/effect give @s creativecommon:magic_resistance 60`
@pass no line from the grep (no `#creativedelight:stoves` WARN); potion names read "Potion of Magic Resistance" in the creative inventory or `/give`; the HUD and inventory show the purple Resistance-style icon, not the purple-black missing texture
@fails icon path, the JEI guards
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell ! grep -nE "magic_resistance.png|JEIEvents|jei_order|damage-tags" logs/latest.log
> item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with minecraft:potion{Potion:"creativecommon:magic_resistance"}
do {"tooltip_text": "held", "expect": "Potion of Magic Resistance"}
> effect give @s creativecommon:magic_resistance 60
do {"effects": true, "expect": "creativecommon:magic_resistance"}
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot inventory_effect_icon
do {"screen": "close"}
shot hud_effect_icon
look both shots: the purple Resistance-style icon, not the purple-black missing texture
## CQ-CCB-02
@group client (full pack)
@commands launch, join a world, open JEI; `grep -nE "jei_order\|fluid_jei\|PackIngredientOrder" logs/latest.log \| head`
@pass `[fluid_jei] added N fluids`; no `could not hand the JEI order`; the JEI list keeps the pack order (Equipment first, by material); dead placeholder fluids still absent; Magic Resistance icon shows
@fails client script load order, `TAG_NAMESPACE`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
do {"wait": "jei"}
shell grep -hnE "jei_order|fluid_jei|PackIngredientOrder" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/client.log | cut -c1-200 | head; true
shell grep -qE "\[fluid_jei\] added [0-9]+ fluids" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/client.log
shell ! grep -q "could not hand the JEI order" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/client.log
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot jei_list_order
do {"screen": "close"}
look the JEI list keeps the pack order (Equipment first, by material); no dead placeholder fluids; the Magic Resistance icon draws
